Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.69,0:04:08.58,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道为何被带到这里 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know why you're here, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean you no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放低了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lowered my gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却举高了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you raised yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.77,0:00:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才太混蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were an asshole out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.53,0:00:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像在亚特兰大的天台上一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like you were on that rooftop back there in Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们遗弃我 不顾我死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}What y'all did, leaving me up there…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.05,0:00:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,人都不会那样对一个动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}people wouldn't do that to an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回去找过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还真贴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't you thoughtful?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我们全去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did, all of us…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 达里尔 T仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, Daryl, T-Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, T-Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.54,0:00:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,大块头黑小伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, big ol' spear-chucker,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:00:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我央求过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one I was pleading with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他却弄掉了钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm, the one that dropped the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where he's at.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.94,0:01:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔肯定希望和解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure T-Dog would like to bury the hatchet,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,既往不咎嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}let bygones be bygones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.89,0:01:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.59,0:01:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我希望他死得很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope he went slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.63,0:01:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.85,0:01:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.18,0:01:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about my baby brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't tell me he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不告诉我他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then hold off on where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.30,0:01:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不说是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.75,0:01:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许那个乡村女会告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe the farmer's daughter will help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.55,0:01:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.07,0:01:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她害怕时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she's scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱紧你时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's holding you close,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.14,0:02:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她颤抖的肌肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and her trembling skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,贴着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}is close to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,软唇相吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}her soft lips are touching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 吻遍这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}here, all over here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and over here…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很棒 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}feels good, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.08,0:02:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你独身潜入城市 心理素质很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the sneaky one, the one with nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你啥都不怕 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't scare easy, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.33,0:02:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.24,0:02:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道我弟弟在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know where my brother is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:03:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道警长在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know where the sheriff is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.65,0:03:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,舒服不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.98,0:03:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道他们躲在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I wanna know where they're hiding,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的营地在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}where your camp is,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.14,0:03:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wanna know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.45,0:03:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到底在哪 快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are they? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.45,0:04:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要帮她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we help her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被咬了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是枪伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 去拿张毯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, get a blanket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝 准备好水和毛巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth, water and a towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.71,0:06:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.68,0:06:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不能去我们的囚室\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not coming in the cell blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 躺好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Steady now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All righ Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.36,0:06:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.03,0:06:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, look at me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Look. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We're not going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.53,0:06:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想做傻事 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you try something stupid first, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna tell us your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna tell us your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们过来看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all come on in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.78,0:07:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看了就明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna wanna see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 卡尔 拿上包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Carl, take the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.93,0:07:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会替你保管好武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll keep this safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的门都锁上了 你很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doors are all locked. You'll be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.02,0:07:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会治好你的伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can treat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没要你们救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.81,0:07:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.09,0:07:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让你随便离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't let you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God. Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人撑下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一路坚持 躲到了一个囚室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor thing fought her way into a cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是脱水昏了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have passed out. Dehydrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:09:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.19,0:09:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你一声 科尔曼先生准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just came to tell you. Mr. Coleman, he's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 我去实验室找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'll meet you in the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.64,0:09:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:09:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上我现在就需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I could use your help with something now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.62,0:10:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish it were just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能给你治伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can tend to that wound for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.87,0:10:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你些食物和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}give you a little food and water,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就送你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then send you on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你必须告诉我们 你是怎么找到这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna have to tell us how you found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有为什么你带着奶粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and why you were carrying formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些补给是一位亚裔男孩和一漂亮姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}The supplies were dropped by a young Asian guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a pretty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被袭击了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were they attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们被带走了 - 谁带走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They were taken. - Taken? By who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.99,0:10:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个开枪打我的狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the same son of a bitch who shot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 他们是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, these are our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上告诉我发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell us what happened now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不许再碰我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever touch me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.49,0:10:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是说出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你面临的问题比枪伤严重多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have a much bigger problem than a gunshot wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:10:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己去找啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find 'em yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 放松 放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, shh, shh, shh. Put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里肯定是想帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫伍德伯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概有75名幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 75 survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.89,0:11:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为他们被带到那里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they were taken there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.32,0:11:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一整个小镇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole town?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个自称总督的人管着这个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's run by this guy who calls himself the Governor…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅气 有魅力 像个邪教头头\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty boy, charming, Jim Jones type.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有手下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got muscle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.55,0:11:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一支自封的准军事部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paramilitary wannabes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,四周围墙上他们都派人持枪巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have armed sentries on every wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know a way in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方行尸进不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place is secure from walkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但活人能溜进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we could slip our way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我们的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know how to get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们提到过一所监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They mentioned a prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:11:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了它在哪个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}said which direction it was in,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,直走就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was a straight shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.11,0:12:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Hershel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个被带走女孩的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}the father of the girl who was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.45,0:12:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会给你处理伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须说声佩服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta hand it to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比我记忆中坚强多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lot tougher than I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪你能活到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}No surprise you lasted this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照「好好警官」的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I figured the way Officer Friendly abandoned people?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该早就把你抛弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would have left you behind by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他没那么做 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he didn't do that, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那告诉我 你们都住在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. So tell me, where y'all been at?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找来只是时间问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a matter of time before they come looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会烤个粉红糖霜蛋糕迎接他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bake a cake with pink frosting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would they like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't nobody coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等他来到这里 - 他什么也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And when he gets here… - He's gonna do nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救不走你和你的小宝贝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not if he wants you and Bo Peep back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为就我一人在这里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I'm in this by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对付不了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't take us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们人可多着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们那群孬种 能有几个真汉子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't a pair of nuts between the whole pussy lot of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.81,0:13:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在外面拼杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been on the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是躲在地牢里\N{\fnArial\fs30}not hiding in some dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.82,0:13:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有瑞克 肖恩 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, Shane, Dale,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.39,0:13:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.45,0:13:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我们可以信任她\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know we can trust her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.07,0:14:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,事关玛姬和格伦 还有什么好争的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Maggie and Glenn. Why are we even debating?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不争了 我去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't. I'll go after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方听起来戒备森严\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this place sounds pretty secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能独自去 - 我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't go alone. - I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,算我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.71,0:14:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带了闪光弹和催泪弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the flash bangs and I got the tear gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定会派上用场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never know what you're gonna need.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.47,0:14:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心你老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't you worry about your old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.83,0:14:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会保护他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep my eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这儿以前不是行尸成堆吗 - 原来是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wasn't this place overrun? - It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.72,0:14:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们靠自己清理光的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you cleared it out all by yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.41,0:14:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你们几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the few of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.07,0:15:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,原本还有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对你妈妈做的事 - 我必须那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What you did for Mom… - I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.81,0:15:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I… I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 对此我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一般人可以做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one should have to go through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long will you be gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果我们走后发生了任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if something happens while we're gone…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,若发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就把大家锁在牢房里 保证他们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get everyone locked in the cells, keep them all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.78,0:15:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会的 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.29,0:15:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾好你妹妹 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of your sister, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔一直管她叫小拽女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl's been calling her Ass-Kicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小拽女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ass-Kicker?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.71,0:16:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就叫上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想 我们该叫她什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking, what should we really call her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我上三年级时的老师 米勒女士吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember my third grade teacher, Mrs. Mueller?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.33,0:16:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的名字叫朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her first name was Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那个名字怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think that's a good name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这是个好名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's… that's a fine name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.34,0:16:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就叫朱迪思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judith it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:16:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命硬着呢 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine lives, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.51,0:17:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔曼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Coleman,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.34,0:18:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.71,0:18:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿会告诉你怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton will bring you up to speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚饭时见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.59,0:18:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你算帮了我们一个大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing us a great service.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你到底在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what exactly are you…?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.39,0:19:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮忙把唱片调到曲目一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you cue up the first song on the record?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫米尔顿·马梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Milton Mamet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果以下的叙述属实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please raise your right hand off the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.67,0:19:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请举起你的右手\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you recognize any of the following statements to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.17,0:19:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫迈克尔·科尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name is Michael Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子是贝蒂·科尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were married to Betty Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.82,0:20:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的孩子叫小迈克尔和艾米丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your children were Michael Jr. And Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他问在等候时 能不能让音乐一直放着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked if I could keep it playing while we wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.63,0:20:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你也来体会一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All righty, I want you to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.90,0:20:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时在天台拼命求生是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}how I felt fighting my way off that roof…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.61,0:20:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一只手\N{\fnArial\fs30}one hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.47,0:21:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,血流不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}losing blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸们龇牙咧嘴 向我步步逼近\N{\fnArial\fs30}walkers chomping down at me every step of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次机会 你队伍在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last chance. Where's your group?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不说是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,请便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.46,0:21:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对它来说算一道大餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a pretty big snack for this fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过人们常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what they say…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.39,0:21:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,「中餐好吃不顶饱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gonna be hungry again in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,开饭了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Run, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔曼先生一死 我们就把他绑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Mr. Coleman passes, we'll restrain him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.05,0:22:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他会变成行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll reanimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.86,0:22:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再问一遍问题 记录下他的回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ask the questions again, record his responses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.20,0:22:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你负责终结他的行尸形态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to end the subject's reanimated state.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.40,0:23:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.45,0:23:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直致力于研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to determine whether.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.61,0:23:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当人变成行尸后是否还具有\N{\fnArial\fs30}trace memory and human consciousness exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.65,0:23:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,记忆痕迹和人性意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}after the subject has transformed,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.23,0:23:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但到目前为止 还没有基准样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I had no baseline to work off of.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.02,0:23:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可供参考\N{\fnArial\fs30}till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他患有前列腺癌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prostate cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.13,0:23:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我们的医疗设备救不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't have the resources to treat him,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.39,0:23:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他自愿献身作试验样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he volunteered to be the test subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.24,0:23:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直都十分配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been very cooperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.79,0:23:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个非常好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a remarkable man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.18,0:23:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们很熟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're close?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.80,0:23:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这样呆在一起好长时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We spent a lot of time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.61,0:23:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,放着的歌曲 手中的颂钵 这些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The song, the singing bowl, the questions…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.76,0:23:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经重复了几十遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've done that a few dozen times.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.76,0:23:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死后 这些信息在他潜意识里\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are cues that will hopefully linger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.19,0:23:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然有可能残存\N{\fnArial\fs30}in his unconscious mind even after he's died.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没有什么潜意识 米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no unconscious mind, Milton.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.73,0:23:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他们醒来 就成怪物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they turn, they become monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.94,0:23:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.68,0:23:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前的他们已不复存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever they once were is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:23:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.87,0:24:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前从没经历过这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't seen this before, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.68,0:24:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,转变的过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}The transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.87,0:24:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.26,0:24:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家里没人变成…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one in your family was…?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.53,0:24:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是独生子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.34,0:24:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候我父母就去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents died when I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.94,0:24:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,事态变糟糕那会儿你也是一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weren't you with anyone when everything went down?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.99,0:24:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那会远程办公\N{\fnArial\fs30}I telecommuted to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.49,0:24:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实从来没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never really…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.03,0:25:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认识安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, they know Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.36,0:25:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们不知道她在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they don't know she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.67,0:25:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们认识你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they do know your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.59,0:25:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那男孩认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.01,0:25:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可女孩我就不清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't know about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.96,0:25:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前没见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen her before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.93,0:25:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的人会来救他俩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their people may come for 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.22,0:25:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.44,0:25:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚和那男孩都说他们回去找过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid and Andrea both say they went back for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.26,0:25:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何 他死活不松口\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? He won't break,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.52,0:25:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不说他们人在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}say where his people are?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.04,0:25:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个顽强的小杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a tough son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.65,0:25:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分钟就把那行尸干掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picked that walker apart in minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.79,0:25:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来野外拼杀了一冬天 这小子有点男人样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a winter in the sticks put some hair on his balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.61,0:25:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们人来了我们需要用他做人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need him for leverage if his people come.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.23,0:25:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you try to kill him for?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.53,0:25:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看他就不顺眼 - 那姑娘说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He pissed me off. - What's the girl say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.76,0:25:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下一个就打算找她谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just about to go talk to her next.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.11,0:25:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是让我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.54,0:26:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,能坐下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.97,0:27:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.27,0:27:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把你送回给你们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take you back to your people,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.53,0:27:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,并解释这一切只是误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}explain this was all just a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.76,0:27:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我们他们在哪儿 我们送你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell us where they are and we'll drive you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.66,0:27:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟格伦说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to talk to Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.99,0:27:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.29,0:27:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的人很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people are dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.78,0:27:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们的人铐在天台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handcuffed my man to a roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.23,0:27:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼着他自行截肢\N{\fnArial\fs30}forced him to amputate his own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.67,0:27:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不知道那些事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.32,0:27:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需坦白他们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just tell us where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.84,0:27:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就把他们带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll bring them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.90,0:27:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很安全 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be safe, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.81,0:27:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.30,0:27:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.02,0:27:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬酒不吃吃罚酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.65,0:27:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请起立\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.22,0:28:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,起立\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.42,0:28:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱掉你的上衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off your shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.79,0:28:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.83,0:28:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱掉你的上衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off your shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.09,0:28:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我剁下格伦的一只手给你送来\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'll bring Glenn's hand in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.20,0:28:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.24,0:30:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you gonna talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.67,0:30:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么 就请自便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do whatever you're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.18,0:30:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,下地狱去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.82,0:31:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有巡逻队\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have patrols.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.57,0:31:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是走过去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're better off on foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.87,0:31:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多远 天马上就黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far? Night's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.17,0:31:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一或两英里的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a mile, maybe two.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.57,0:31:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我和我孩子所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, what you did for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.13,0:31:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我还在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}for my baby, while I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.96,0:31:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,整理思绪时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}working things out…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.84,0:31:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.08,0:31:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙伴就该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.42,0:32:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞克 - 蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick. - Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.55,0:32:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持战术阵型 别开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Formation. No gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.98,0:32:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.59,0:32:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在是太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.88,0:32:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.98,0:32:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那里 快跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through there. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.36,0:32:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.67,0:32:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别出声 别出声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it down. Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.80,0:32:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这味道 真冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The smell, it's loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.92,0:32:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.84,0:33:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是狐狸或什么动物的遗体\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be a fox or what's left of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.91,0:33:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来忠犬拼了命救主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess Lassie went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.36,0:33:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们他妈是谁 - 我们没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah! Who the hell are you? - We don't mean any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.19,0:33:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快从我家滚出去 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get outta my house! - Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.89,0:33:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会走的 但现在走不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will, but we can't right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.74,0:33:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快滚 - 让他闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now! - Shut him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.22,0:33:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就给我滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.47,0:33:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有一堆行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are walkers outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.91,0:34:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要报警 - 我就是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll call the cops! - I am a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.10,0:34:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请你把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I need you to lower the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.23,0:34:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别鲁莽行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do anything rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.19,0:34:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切好说 咱们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's fine. Let's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.13,0:34:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,和和气气地放下枪 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's just take this nice and slow, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.50,0:34:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.53,0:34:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看你的警徽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me your badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.64,0:34:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 在我口袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. It's in my pocket. It's in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.87,0:34:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我慢慢伸手去拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm just gonna reach down nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.31,0:34:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开 快放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.85,0:34:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.98,0:34:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.23,0:34:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.44,0:34:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊 他们发现我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! They found me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.87,0:34:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命 - 别开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help me! - Don't open that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.75,0:34:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,四面楚歌啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the Alamo?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.56,0:35:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔 准备开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, help me with the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.45,0:35:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是真要这么做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.18,0:35:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经死了 去后门看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead. Check the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.39,0:35:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,后门安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.42,0:35:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.03,0:35:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.38,0:36:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫米尔顿·马梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Milton Mamet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.19,0:36:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果以下的叙述属实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please raise your right hand off the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.75,0:36:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,请举起你的右手\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you recognize any of the following statements to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.29,0:36:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫迈克尔·科尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name is Michael Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.22,0:36:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子是贝蒂·科尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were married to Betty Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.64,0:36:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的孩子叫小迈克尔和艾米丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your children were Michael Jr. And Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.56,0:36:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没 他有反应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that? He responded.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.30,0:36:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,手指动一动 说明不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their fingers move. That could be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.26,0:36:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他手被绑着 所以举不起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he can't raise his hand. It's the angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.74,0:36:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他松开让我再试一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to try again without the restraints.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.56,0:36:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 我们说不定已经触及他的意识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - We may have tethered his consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.92,0:36:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 必须要试试 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to try. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.97,0:36:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这会有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what happens if the subject comes for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.06,0:36:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要你来就是保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you're here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.07,0:36:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦解开束缚 它就会攻击你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as we pull the restraints, he'll lunge.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.39,0:36:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫米尔顿·马梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Milton Mamet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.25,0:36:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请举起你的右手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please raise your right hand…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.50,0:37:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想趁热打铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'd like to record my findings.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.02,0:37:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录实验结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}while they're fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.03,0:37:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.56,0:37:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,小打小闹到此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're through with games.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.26,0:37:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们中一人必须说出营地位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now one of you is gonna give up your camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.56,0:38:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.54,0:38:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,努内兹附近那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one near Nunez?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.38,0:38:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方被行尸占据了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That place is overrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.24,0:38:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们攻下了那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.47,0:38:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们有多少人 - 十人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many are you? - 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.35,0:38:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还剩十人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have 10 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.21,0:38:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅靠十人清理掉了整个监狱的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 people cleared that whole prison of biters?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.26,0:38:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, shh, shh. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.84,0:38:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.18,0:38:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.64,0:39:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅靠十人\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.63,0:39:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那在危险区\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's deep in the red zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.83,0:39:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 十个人不可能… - 她在撒谎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no way only 10… - So she's lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.72,0:39:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她撒谎 那么就有一大队人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause if she's lying, that means a pretty sizeable force.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.12,0:39:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}has moved into our backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.44,0:39:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果她没撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if she's not,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.07,0:39:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟的这群人马\N{\fnArial\fs30}this group with your brother at its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.04,0:39:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成了不可能完成的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}has done something you told me couldn't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.60,0:39:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.84,0:39:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟说不定正在外面 搜寻他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother might be out there right now, searching for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.40,0:39:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,常言道「血浓于水」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood is blood, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.52,0:40:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好奇你会忠于哪边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes me wonder where your loyalties lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.47,0:40:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忠于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.11,0:40:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩带一小队人去侦查监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two get a small group and scout this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.72,0:40:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道对方的底细\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know exactly what we're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.94,0:40:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 立刻去办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.04,0:41:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遵守诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kept your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.86,0:41:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you'd be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.03,0:41:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿那边还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything go all right with Milton?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.74,0:41:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.32,0:41:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔曼先生死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Coleman died.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.55,0:41:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿找到想找的东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did Milton find what he was looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.92,0:41:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.13,0:42:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.80,0:42:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.22,0:42:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
